WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.934
The biggest story,
really, probably,

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:03.169
while we were off
for these five months

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:06.472
was Trump being put on trial--
or he's gonna have--

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:07.506
he's got four trials.

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:11.878
He's got a "I gave hush money
to a porn star" trial.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:16.081
He's got a
"I stole documents and put them
by the toilet" trial.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:17.383
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:20.753
He has a "I asked
for 11,000 votes" trial

00:00:20.853 --> 00:00:22.922
and "I tried to overthrow
the government" trial.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:24.357
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.726
So, I just want to say,
even if you're a fan,

00:00:26.792 --> 00:00:27.927
that's a lot of trials.

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:33.199
-(LAUGHTER, APPLAUSE)
-So we thought...

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:38.737
since the chances are very good

00:00:38.837 --> 00:00:40.339
that he will get convicted
of one of these,

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:41.707
we thought as a public service,

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:43.776
because we're always
about the public service here,

00:00:44.376 --> 00:00:46.145
we would put out
a little pamphlet called,

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:48.047
"Tips for Donald Trump's
Cellmate".

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:50.149
He's probably gonna have
a cellmate.

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:53.887
So these are things
you might want to look out for

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:55.888
if you are, you know,
if you're the person

00:00:55.988 --> 00:00:57.423
who becomes
Donald Trump's cellmate.

00:00:57.523 --> 00:01:00.259
Don't believe him when he says
how many cigarettes he's worth.

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:03.630
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:05.898
Explain to him
that he's not allowed

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:07.700
conjugal visits
from his daughter.

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:12.571
(LAUGHTER, GROANING)

00:01:13.038 --> 00:01:14.873
He loves compliments,
so tell him,

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:17.143
"That jumpsuit really
brings out your orange."

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.979
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.615
Don't-- Don't be surprised

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:25.551
if one of his cavity searches
turns up Sean Hannity.

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:29.556
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:34.961
When he begs
some Mexican inmates

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:36.262
to help him get over the wall,

00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:38.831
refrain from pointing out
the obvious irony.

00:01:39.031 --> 00:01:43.670
(LAUGHTER, APPLAUSE)

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:49.308
Let him know that singing
<i> Y.M.C.A.</i> in the shower

00:01:49.408 --> 00:01:50.877
might send the wrong signal.

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.878
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:01:53.145 --> 00:01:54.246
Don't get aggravated

00:01:54.346 --> 00:01:57.016
when he keeps referring to
his one phone call as "perfect."

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.985
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:01:59.318 --> 00:02:01.387
He's a big eater,
so don't be surprised

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:04.456
when he takes a shiv
and makes it into a spoon.

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:08.728
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:12.164
And finally, when he offers--

00:02:12.297 --> 00:02:14.634
when he offers to blow you
for a Diet Coke,

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:17.303
make sure you get
the blow job first.

